{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200760/extras/DetailBilder_Exploration.png?t=1674165091\" /><br><br>Navigate the small ship and its Crew in a short Adventure. Explore the mysterious, hostile Swamp in North-East Germany filled with secrets and horrors.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200760/extras/DetailBilder_Narrative.png?t=1674165091\" /><br><br>Experience the condensed story of the inquisitive Professor and the gruff Captain. The longer they stay in the muddy waters, the greater the impact on their psyche - except if they escape fast enough.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2200760/extras/DetailBilder_Flavour.png?t=1674165091\" /><br><br>The Story is linear - but it is your decision, how the protagonists process the events and what consequences they draw.<br><br><br>[+] Lovecraftian Horror - but <strong>without jumpscares</strong> nor graphical violence!<br>[+] Navigate the Ship out of a Top-Down perspective. Only Mouse and Keyboard needed.<br>[+] Gather Collectibles to learn more about the unique Lore.<br>[+] Dynamic, but condensed Narrative.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome To The Bog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2200760/8fa7908c259cad1a855db5c78243c6ea21b9fab9.jpg"},{"name":"Peatschnaps causes Blindness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2200760/8962f2ac6697ed254fa8ea490fa2c8b8daf8f802.jpg"},{"name":"Nausea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2200760/dcd8de53d9993d44393644c6b20fe7b62ce9c6d4.jpg"},{"name":"Time To Leave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2200760/78e21fd97c4e60653aa62f73a1c926772d1f7eb0.jpg"},{"name":"Schabernack","path":"https:/